00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.576 line:92%
-I can't think of any right now.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:53.513 size:81% position:41%
-I can't think of any,
my dear bud and pal.

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:54.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I really can't.
-No.

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:57.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
