I understand your point.

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:46.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
I see where
you're going with this.

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:48.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's fair.
So, I'll let you speak.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:52.939 line:92%
But, um, that's more corporate.

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:55.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what I'm saying?
That's like a corporate view.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.977 line:92%
-Well, they're a corporation.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:02:59.445 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:02.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's a very good point.
So I stand corrected.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:05.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, like, if Jeff Bezos
