I would say Pittsburgh.

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:10.690
-Okay. Well, I think Pittsburgh
is actually in the running.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:11.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Oh, is it?
-Yeah.

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:12.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, great.
-I think you maybe said it

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:15.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
