-They get to use the rides.

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:31.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what I mean?
-"The castle."

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:32.412 line:92%
-I don't feel like Disney

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:33.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
