00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:35.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They could ask them.
They could ask.

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.816
Like, "Hey, can we use
the castle? Do you mind?"

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:39.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Please, sir, please?"
-"Please?"

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:40.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They would say "please"
like that.

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Please, sir, please, sir.
